,"display":{"type":"file","path":"/private/tmp/d_l2_smoke/AGENTS.md","text":"# Workspace routing policy\n\nThis workspace delegates finance-domain work to specialist subagents via the `task` tool.\n\n## Delegation rules\n\n- **量化策略研究与回测**（因子库浏览/bench、IC/IR 分析、策略目录与证据、写并运行 signal_engine 回测、回测诊断、ML walk-forward、执行成本建模、K线形态识别、回测工作区文件、策略导出 Pine/vnpy）→ delegate to **quant-agent**. Delegate the whole task with a self-contained brief (objective, expected outputs, constraints); do not do the domain work yourself first.\n- **网页检索与文档阅读**（免 key 网页搜索兜底、网页转 Markdown、扫描版 PDF 或多格式文档提文字、工具用法咨询）→ delegate to **web-docs-agent**.\n- 简单一句话事实查询（如\"GTJA191 有多少个因子\"）且你确定一个工具调用即可回答 → 可以直接回答，不必委派。\n- 不属于以上两域的任务（基本面、宏观、新闻、本地代码、组合风险指标、交易连接）→ 主循环直接处理，不要委派给这两个子代理。\n- After delegation, do not duplicate the subagent's work; use its returned summary and artifact paths.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":11,"totalLines":11,"truncated":false}},"title":"private/tmp/d_l2_smoke/AGENTS.md","time":{"start":1787913087921,"end":1787913088904}},"id":"prt_047ecab9d001NSEYDgET0vW51M","sessionID":"ses_fb813b386ffe6Vi16EMSCAukjL","messageID":"msg_047ec5982001Tb1q6Hu1QEEj8E"}}
